 1985 A:0b2b                                    ; CHEAD GOES THROUGH PROGRAM STORAGE AND FIXES
 1986 A:0b2b                                    ; UP ALL THE LINKS. THE END OF EACH LINE IS FOUND
 1987 A:0b2b                                    ; BY SEARCHING FOR THE ZERO AT THE END.
