 2012 A:0b4f                                    ; THIS IS THE LINE INPUT ROUTINE.
 2013 A:0b4f                                    ; IT READS CHARACTERS INTO BUF USING BACKARROW (UNDERSCORE, OR
 2014 A:0b4f                                    ; SHIFT O) AS THE DELETE CHARACTER AND @ AS THE 
 2015 A:0b4f                                    ; LINE DELETE CHARACTER. IF MORE THAN BUFLEN CHARACTERS
