 2327 A:0c63                                    ;
 2328 A:0c63                                    ; CLEAR INITIALIZES THE VARIABLE AND
 2329 A:0c63                                    ; ARRAY SPACE BY RESETING ARYTAB (THE END OF SIMPLE VARIABLE SPACE)
 2330 A:0c63                                    ; AND STREND (THE END OF ARRAY STORAGE). IT FALLS INTO "STKINI"
 2331 A:0c63                                    ; WHICH RESETS THE STACK. 
