 3652 A:11c0                                    ;
 3653 A:11c0                                    ; IN THE PROCESSING OF DATA AND READ STATEMENTS:
 3654 A:11c0                                    ; ONE POINTER POINTS TO THE DATA (IE, THE NUMBERS BEING FETCHED)
 3655 A:11c0                                    ; AND ANOTHER POINTS TO THE LIST OF VARIABLES.
 3656 A:11c0                                    ;
 3657 A:11c0                                    ; THE POINTER INTO THE DATA ALWAYS STARTS POINTING TO A
 3658 A:11c0                                    ; TERMINATOR -- A , : OR END-OF-LINE.
 3659 A:11c0                                    ;
 3660 A:11c0                                    ; AT THIS POINT TXTPTR POINTS TO LIST OF VARIABLES AND
 3661 A:11c0                                    ; [Y,X] POINTS TO DATA OR INPUT LINE.
 3662 A:11c0                                    ;

 3664 A:11c0  86 82                              stx INPPTR
