 4879 A:1804                                    ;
 4880 A:1804                                    ; AT THIS POINT [LOWTR,Y] POINTS BEYOND THE SIZE TO THE NUMBER OF
 4881 A:1804                                    ; DIMENSIONS. STRATEGY:
 4882 A:1804                                    ; NUMDIM=NUMBER OF DIMENSIONS.
 4883 A:1804                                    ; CURTOL=0.
 4884 A:1804                                    ; INLPNM:GET A NEW INDICE.
