 5570 A:1bc3                                    ;
 5571 A:1bc3                                    ; "FRETMP" IS PASSED A STRING DESCRIPTOR PNTR IN [Y,A].
 5572 A:1bc3                                    ; A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE STRING DESCRIPTOR POINTS TO THE LAST
 5573 A:1bc3                                    ; TEMPORARY DESCRIPTOR ALLOCATED BY PUTNEW.
 5574 A:1bc3                                    ; IF SO, THE TEMPORARY IS FREED UP BY THE UPDATING OF [TEMPPT].
 5575 A:1bc3                                    ; IF A TEMP IS FREED UP, A FURTHER CHECK SEES IF THE STRING DATA THAT
 5576 A:1bc3                                    ; THAT STRING TEMP PNT'D TO IS THE LOWEST PART OF STRING SPACE IN USE.
 5577 A:1bc3                                    ; IF SO, [FRETOP] IS UPDATED TO REFLECT THE FACT THE FACT THAT THE SPACE
 5578 A:1bc3                                    ; IS NO LONGER IN USE.
 5579 A:1bc3                                    ; THE ADDR OF THE ACTUAL STRING IS RETURNED IN [Y,X] AND
 5580 A:1bc3                                    ; ITS LENGTH IN ACCA.
 5581 A:1bc3                                    ;
 5582 A:1bc3                           FRESTR    
 5582 A:1bc3  20 3b 13                           jsr CHKSTR                ;MAKE SURE ITS A STRING.
 5583 A:1bc6                           FREFAC    
